OpenBench Authors
=================

This file lists the authors of OpenBench in chronological order of
first contribution. The canonical machine-readable record is in
CITATION.cff.

When you submit a pull request that lands in the main branch, please
add yourself to this list as part of the same commit.

* Karan Singh <karansingh25822@gmail.com> — original author and maintainer (2026-present)
